  9	 *
 10	 * Tool calling (Notary Chat): the same call with `tools: [{type:"function", function:{name,
 11	 * description, parameters}}]` and `tool_choice`; the reply's `message.tool_calls` carry
 12	 * `{id, type:"function", function:{name, arguments}}` (finish_reason "tool_calls" → stop reason
