 16	 * - `maxRetries: 0`: the SDK's own 429/5xx retries are off; Notary's limiter decides about retries,
 17	 *   so a retried call can never be metered twice.
 18	 * - Tracing: when neatlogs is on the client is wrapped with the SDK's `wrapOpenAI`, which emits the
 19	 *   one LLM span per HTTP call (messages already secret-scrubbed by the caller). Notary's own
 20	 *   `notary.llm` span stays a CHAIN with role / model / tokens / USD (DECISIONS #78).
