 22	 *   proxy returns a plain Promise (no `.withResponse()`), so headers are captured by a fetch wrapper
 23	 *   keyed by a per-call request header that is stripped before the request leaves the process.
 24	 * - The key is only handed to the SDK; it is never put in an error, span attribute or log line here,
 25	 *   and callers scrub every error message with the env scrubber as a backstop.
